{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-15_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-15","title":"誰來傾訴","storyCode":"13-17","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"494c43309dd1ff23ad5a025faa3c78730d35b35a3de7a3b25a17c0676477e007","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）魔王死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）魔王殺死了魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）為什麼，不該是這樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）我們的城市，卡茲戴爾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）這會是詛咒！這會是刻印進王冠的詛咒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）這會是……一切災難的開始——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天一早，進攻就會開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王和她的“典範軍”將負責外圍的牽制，我們，羅德島的小兔子和女妖需要深入那座停靠站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希那老女人呢？這麼危險的行動，她只派我們送死，自己不出點力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的傷還沒有痊癒，阿斯卡綸會保證她和博士的安全，他們都會留在後方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島在不久前曾遭到赦罪師的襲擊，那些人想奪取小兔子的那頂王冠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，王冠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……赫德雷，你沒跟那些維多利亞人說實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的計劃成功了，我們回到了卡茲戴爾，你打算幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是和你當了朋友的維多利亞人，恐怕也不會接受你連“戰犯”和“被捲進戰爭的薩卡茲”一起打包帶走這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我你信誓旦旦地告訴我們“會帶薩卡茲們回家”，自己卻沒考慮過這個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，去卡茲戴爾那座地窖裡的大學，給這些從戰場上回來的傢伙開一門，呵，“反思歷史”的課？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也許會在卡茲戴爾開個識字班，讓薩卡茲以後少幾個W這樣的文盲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒聽錯吧？赫德雷居然在這麼嚴肅的話題上也能順著伊內絲的話開玩笑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，討好曼弗雷德將軍讓你情商高了一點點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“戰爭結束，回到卡茲戴爾。”多可笑，我們居然在這裡幻想這些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是傭兵，我們不會別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個可愛的卡普里尼，伊內絲，你說不定可以去萊塔尼亞，給那些住在塔裡的高高在上的貴族們當家教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就教……我想想，教怎麼在戰場上保持秀髮靚麗，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在發什麼呆？馬上就要開戰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，以前你說過，你打算開一家店，在卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為當時我們沒有銷贓的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在識字班賺的第一筆學費，當做你的本錢怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很懷疑識字班能賺到多少錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，綁一個萊塔尼亞的貴族家教能掙的贖金倒是不會少，起碼比十個僱傭兵的頭值錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先等我們真的回了家再說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的精神狀態讓我懷疑你能不能勝任接下來的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被幻境啊法陣啊之類的折磨的傻了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別理這個一向多愁善感的傻子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間不等人。等我們宰了那個血魔，宰了特雷西斯，你們大可以回到卡茲戴爾慢慢商量愛巢的裝修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事我想了很久，W。接下來我要說的也許你無法接受，但我還是得告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，在開打前給人潑冷水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能殺特雷西斯，起碼不能在此時此刻，由薩卡茲處決他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲說得對，你確實是被幻象折磨的傻了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺了他，卡茲戴爾將不復存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是在現在，還是在戰爭結束後的相當一段時間裡，他都必須以攝政王的身份被記載……乃至，被部分人歌頌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你瘋了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這件事上我不想開玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們仍要停止這場戰爭，我並未改變先前的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但特雷西斯已經把自己澆築成了薩卡茲未來的基石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾不能再遭受一次分裂，這場戰爭……也不能結束於薩卡茲的又一次背叛和內戰的開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得我之前說的計劃嗎？我們需要的是在所有人得知他的死亡之前，讓這片戰場上的薩卡茲們撤離維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的失敗一旦公開，特雷西斯的威懾一旦不復存在——那麼，會發生什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵們會肆無忌憚地屠殺維多利亞境內的薩卡茲，報復會延伸至核心圈的其他國家，每一個文明都有正當藉口……把薩卡茲趕盡殺絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後組織一支聯軍，合理又正義、迅速又果決地……瓜分特蕾西婭和特雷西斯留下的所有遺產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想不到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我一點都不在乎特雷西斯的死會有什麼後果，我需要的只是他的“死”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯軍？殺死薩卡茲？他們不原本就在做這樣的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道特雷西斯一死，魔族佬們就連反抗的欲望也集體消散了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呿。我不會，我也不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他派刺客殺了特蕾西婭，自詡為王，把所有人拖進今天這般田地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不需要為了他的卡茲戴爾，委身於他的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別以為自己能置身事外，W。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還以為自己不過是一個傭兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶來了多少人？從整合運動到現在，你聚集了多少薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在背負著他們的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我他媽不在乎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，你只要和以前一樣，殺殺人，埋埋炸彈就行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在是那些薩卡茲的領袖，你必須要想清楚，你該怎麼處置他們的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須想清楚，這些命，對你意味著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不止特雷西斯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，還有特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，從所有角度來說，我們都……只能是他們的繼承者，是他們理念的延伸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們兩人，才是薩卡茲能團結起來的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那不是真的特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那不過是特雷西斯造出來的冒牌貨，他騙不過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正視你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以為你是誰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不能接受特蕾西婭的死，你習慣了當巴別塔的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"甚至……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"住口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得有阿米婭走在你的前面。你覺得，她才是特蕾西婭選定的繼承人，“魔王”才該考慮這些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把她看作另一個特蕾西婭，你覺得，只需要追隨“魔王”就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"住嘴！你在故意揶揄我嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你覺得自己不配繼承什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……開什麼玩笑，你自以為你了解我嗎？你真把自己當成教育我的人了，赫德雷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也只是個僱傭兵，比我高不到哪裡去。你就能自詡為繼承者了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呸，噁心死了！小兔子？還我追隨她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她就是個機緣巧合之下才被——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——才被特蕾西婭選中，成了阻止整合運動和塔露拉，今天又打進了倫蒂尼姆的羅德島領導人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W，特蕾西婭對於你到底意味著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是個曾經讓你有個容身之所的遙遠象徵，那個具體的有血有肉的殿下，還是——她所代表的路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“為了這片大地……能夠安穩入眠。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以……我才會說，她是假的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……伊內絲，你是怎麼忍著這麼久沒宰了他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我很少騙自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呿。少來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別瞎操心了，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道自己該做什麼。這次就不以動搖軍心的名義宰了你，你該給我磕個頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好磨利你的劍，準備好明天的戰鬥吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……還是逃開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的覺得，她能成個像樣的領袖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她組織起了一大批僱傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，真的是“僱傭兵”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W能有什麼錢雇他們？她做的事又能幫他們賺幾個錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，那些跟著W的人，到底是因為什麼跟著她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管她自己怎麼說，為特蕾西婭報仇也好，追殺當年刺殺的參與者也罷，還是說自己什麼都沒想，只是一路狂轟濫炸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她都確實……已經走在了那條路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……跟著她混的人真可憐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實很多人都忘了，她還很年輕。她有很大的……進步空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，第一筆錢給你開店，不是玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“典範軍”已經整備完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆自救軍的一部分成員，自願加入了我們的隊伍中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，加上我們這一路收攏的原本屬於各個公爵的殘兵、想要參與戰鬥的難民和自救軍的這些民兵，我們大概有了六七個連的兵力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，我們最好正式建立“典範軍”的軍制，任命軍官，這樣我們的指揮系統才……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希勒少尉，這支隊伍不是一支真的軍隊。“維多利亞的軍隊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，我們有一些士兵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但除去你和戴菲恩帶領的溫德米爾公爵的殘部，其餘的只是想要戰鬥的普通人。工人，農民，商人，當然，還有街頭流氓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們把他們強行編進一兩個戰鬥小組裡面，再給他們塞一把武器，就要他們聽命於軍官們的指揮，我們和那些公爵有什麼區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“典範軍”是個很好的名頭。但我認為它應該給人們帶來純粹的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者別把話說那麼大，為人們帶來一點公爵們的高速軍艦所帶不來的，虛無縹緲的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍不該是由手握國劍的王位繼承人統領的英雄軍隊。我相當反感這些名頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我們該怎麼組織軍事行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說軍事行動，我們的隊伍裡也有相當部分的人連正規的軍事訓練都沒有接受過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入鄉隨俗吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我們在切特雷鎮做的那樣，就像自救軍在倫蒂尼姆做的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還是和自己熟悉的人，用自己喜歡的方式，去殺那些薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……無意冒犯，薩卡茲們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨。我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儀式已被終止，但殘留在薩卡茲血脈中的賜福，並沒有徹底消弭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆的方向……古老的巫術在翻騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的死敵有著不可告人的目的，但他們所表露出的緊迫倉促，反而能成為突破的助力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會加倍注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們搶回那根香骨頭吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g4_spinestops_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計劃很成功，那幫維多利亞人的進攻確實為我們引開了一部分這裡的軍隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們進來了，它確實在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，是上次的那幾個薩卡茲？你們怎麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們和維多利亞人，一起進攻這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺死這些叛徒！殺死這些薩卡茲的叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄爾蘇拉沒有親自迎接我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos猜得對，看來她確實正忙得不可開交。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——上次你們沒讓我跟進來，這可真是個大傢伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能把它炸成兩截嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，跟上隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上登上脊椎，控制它的操縱者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我感覺到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
